screen-orientation-manager (1.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of Screen Orientation Manager for X11.
  * Rotate touchscreen and touchpad input for laptops/tablets.
  * Simple GTK3 interface for device selection and rotation.
  * Saves device configuration for future sessions.

